.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-board-sweep 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-board\-sweep \- Run every declared board gate over one payload set and report the set of refusals
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten board sweep\fR [\fB\-\-issue\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run every declared board gate over one payload set and report the set of refusals
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-issue\fR \fI<issue>\fR
Read this issue\*(Aqs payload from the capture store rather than stdin (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
